{"pageid":3475,"title":"Version 1.30.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Version 1.30.0</span>","revid":15593,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Version_1.30.0\">Version 1.30.0</span></h2>\n<p><b>July 26th, 2023</b>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Added:\">Added:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">THE GRABBIEST GRABBER</a>!</li>\n<li>Water now waves up and down, including <a href=\"/wiki/Boxed_Water\" title=\"Boxed Water\">boxed water</a></li>\n<li>The inventory can now have their tools moved around by dragging</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changed:\">Changed:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Both new variants of <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Cactus\" title=\"Classic Cactus\">Stud Cactus</a>' sell price has been increased</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Refinery\" title=\"Rusty Refinery\">Rusty Refinery</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Chisel\" title=\"Rusty Chisel\">Rusty Chisel</a> have been placed back on the default shelves</li>\n<li>Changed material of water to be better than smooth plastic</li>\n<li>Rewrote <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">grabby grabber</a> to be more performant and work on mobile</li>\n<li>Shutdown indicator now shows when driving</li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bug_Fixes:\">Bug Fixes:</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Fixed issue which prevented 2/3 of the new <a href=\"/wiki/Classic_Store\" title=\"Classic Store\">Stud shop</a> items from appearing (sorry)</li>\n<li>Fixed spawn locations not working when loading property</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903151127\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.010 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.015 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 17/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHi